# Inline editorial links

- Use `INLINE_LINK_CLASS` from `src/components/inlineLink.ts` for inline or editorial text links.
- Let links inherit their surrounding text color; hover and keyboard focus turn `blue-500`.
- Keep the shared underline, 200ms color transition, and visible focus treatment.
- Do not apply this class to navigation, card links, icon controls, button-like anchors, error actions, or intentionally branded one-offs.
